# Docker build context for Hearth Worker container images.
#
# `wrangler deploy` (and `wrangler dev`) build a [[containers]] image with the
# REPOSITORY ROOT as the build context, so without this file the context would
# include every `target/`, `build/` and generated directory. The Dockerfile's own
# `Dockerfile.dockerignore` only applies to plain `docker build -f <name>`
# invocations; wrangler renames the Dockerfile, so this root file is what keeps
# its context to source.
.git
**/target
**/build
**/.wrangler
**/node_modules
**/*.wasm
bench
docs
godot
unity
